{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize the hash into the promised half-open interval**\n\nDividing by the maximum unsigned 32-bit value maps `0xffffffff` to exactly `1.0`, producing `[0,1]` rather than the documented `[0,1)` and potentially differing from cross-SDK deterministic sampling decisions. Divide by `2^32` and add a fixed-vector compatibility test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ndPQM","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":365,"observation_digest":"fcc96cb1b51e6f1a9307e90eab49a8bc92d3177a338259bbfea6ec551acb759b","observation_id":"aro_v1_7tewzmnvdzxrveyh5ehkwsnixs","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-28T18:51:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gt3udxuqrq2ytrrljtxxqqzq2v","reviewed_base_sha":"6d9ad7cd02e488db2a3c02d5706d65e09258e325","reviewed_head_sha":"9cb8201925cb2f7037febfc689f7203018703bd4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":365,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_c3l3jqnlsdc55e6mhb55mknps4"},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_ng3t22og57zmhr2nwguqkgqacp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T18:51:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
